flowchart TB
  R[Eligible root masks from selected clusters] --> P[Take the best pending node]
  P -->|Bound cannot improve| D[Discard node]
  P -->|Small active set| S[Scan leaf mask and score rows]
  P -->|Split needed| X[Intersect with next bitplane]
  X --> C[Queue both nonempty children]
  D --> N{Continue within budget?}
  S --> N
  C --> N
  N -->|Yes| P
  N -->|No| O[Return current candidates]
